{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16865","headline":"竹 · 朱放","name":"竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青林何森然，沈沈独曙前。\n出墙同淅沥，开户满婵娟。\n箨卷初呈粉，苔侵乱上钱。\n疎中思水过，深处若山连。\n叠夜常栖露，清朝乍有蝉。\n砌阴迎缓策，檐翠对欹眠。\n迸笋双分箭，繁梢一向偏。\n月过惊散雪，风动极闻泉。\n幽谷添诗谱，高人欲制篇。\n萧萧意何恨，不独往湘川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱放","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}